[en.FOCUS_C18_YOUNG_YIN]
Young Yin

[en.FOCUS_C18_YOUNG_YIN_desc]
The world is in its dusk, looking towards the future, there is only the endless night without end. Rather than giving up hope, the meaning of dusk to us may exactly be an opportunity to prepare supplies and get ready for the arrival of the night.\nIf the peace-loving species is best at war, if the self-sufficient agricultural kingdom is best at industry, then how can a group of Kirins who long for dawn fear the dusk?

[zh.FOCUS_C18_YOUNG_YIN]
少阴

[zh.FOCUS_C18_YOUNG_YIN_desc]
世界已处于其黄昏，望向未来，唯有不见尽头的漫漫长夜。而与其放弃希望，黄昏存在的意义或许就是让我们筹备物资，准备迎接黑夜的到来。\n如果一个爱好和平的种族最擅长战争，如果一个千年农耕的国度最擅长工业，那么一群憧憬黎明的麒麟们又怎会惧怕黄昏呢？

